  "id": "mitral-cell",
  "term": "mitral cell",
  "definition": "A mitral cell is a nerve cell in the olfactory pathway whose dendrites receive incoming smell-related impulses in a glomerule. In this account, it serves as an early relay through which stimulation from the nasal lining can pass onward toward higher brain regions involved in smell.",
